==Strategy==
This stage has the same general concept as the first stage in this subchapter: pair up Ange Lackey with beefy enemies and watch the players suffer. Unlike that first stage which you could just kill the Bun Bun really fast, here you're forced to deal with a buffed Sir Metal Seal and Ange Lackeys. At the start of the stage, clear out the Croconators fast as you'll need a constant cash flow to fight this stage properly. You can use either [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] or even [[Backhoe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Backhoe Cat]] to kill them quickly. Once the first Sir Metal Seal appears, spam all of your anti-Metal units like [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]], [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Corrupted Moneko]] and [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]]. Even buffed at 360%, the sole Sir Metal Seal should die without Ange Lackey landing too many hits on your stack, and once that happens send in [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to kill it. From there, you should be able to rush the stage before the next Sir Metal Seal spawns.

==Trivia==
*Nata de Coco Way's Japanese name, Hikyō Nata de Kodō (秘境ナタ・デ古道, "Secluded Nata de Old Road"), contains a pun on ''[[wikipedia:Nata de coco|nata de coco]]'' and 古道 ''kodō'' (old road).

